{
  "_comment": [
    "The two columns, by tone. Three of each are drawn per day, and they",
    "render under the headings 'More of' and 'Less of'. The keys stay 'do'",
    "and 'dont' because renaming them would rewrite 200 lines of content to",
    "no purpose; the heading is the part a reader sees.",
    "",
    "Noun phrases rather than instructions, so they read as aphorism rather",
    "than as advice: 'Happy hour' invites a thought, 'go to happy hour'",
    "issues an order and gets ignored. Keep them short, concrete and slightly",
    "oblique. Anything that reads as a self-help imperative belongs somewhere",
    "else. Add freely: more entries here cost nothing and the picker takes",
    "three at random from whatever is present."
  ],
